WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.847
This briefing comes from Book 16 of
the Federal Modernization Workbook,

2
00:00:04.847 --> 00:00:06.925
People: Training and Education.

3
00:00:06.925 --> 00:00:09.487
It's written for C I Os and CISOs,

4
00:00:09.487 --> 00:00:14.200
workforce and training leads,
I S S Os, and help desk leads.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.947
I'll take four questions: why
people, not tools, close the gap;

6
00:00:17.947 --> 00:00:21.537
what the program teaches;
who owns workforce readiness;

7
00:00:21.537 --> 00:00:25.362
and how to run the curriculum
and measure whether it worked.

8
00:00:25.362 --> 00:00:29.463
The short version: every book before
this one changes what someone does.

9
00:00:29.463 --> 00:00:33.121
Tools enforce the new rules,
but people run the estate,

10
00:00:33.121 --> 00:00:36.000
and a program that trains last pays twice.
